0c68ae1013d29525ecde2a8bf267ced9fc035", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb/runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc#L694-L720"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "pin": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc", "lines": [499, 537], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "a8fd1a35c355b26f9df88a8126a97698119838b3", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb/runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc#L499-L537"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "pin": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc", "lines": [1580, 1601], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "7f0c11965198f19f5429fb2c85f44f6f897ec118", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb/runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc#L1580-L1601"}, {"type": "empirical", "path": "generated/models/e4b-ours.md", "detail": "signature prefill_1024 inputs: embeddings FLOAT32[1, 1024, 2560], per_layer_embeddings FLOAT32[1, 1024, 42, 256], no token-id input"}], "note": "Second read, 2026-11-17 (agent a, on executors.md): decode still leaves an id-only pending TokenData (b7b856a0 executor.cc:1611-1632) and FillInputBufferWithToken's id-and-zeros fallback (:499-537) is unchanged, but PrefillInternal now calls LookupPendingTokenEmbeddings (:539-563, call in :694-748; ours a82611eb, 2026-11-17, not an ancestor of the release 6da75396). Agrees with z-repin-c."}
{"id": "X-GAP-004", "verdict": "corrected", "corrected_text": "In our build, after SetCurrentStep moves current_step below the processed-token count (as the channel-content filter's rewind does), the next prefill's RollBackProcessedTokens truncates the processed tokens and re-adds the token at current_step - 1 as a new id-only pending TokenData; after the filter's rewind to the checkpoint saved after the user prefill, that token is the '\\n' ending '<|turn>model\\n', which the refill prefill writes from its looked-up embeddings (ours: a82611eb), so the refill ('...<turn|>', with the final '\\n' left pending) matches the template's render. In the release Agello ships, that '\\n' position is rewritten from an id-and-zeros row.", "corrected_sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc", "lines": [565, 595], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "fdcb39d1b67ea879315dadd2469937557e22bd63", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc#L565-L595"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc", "lines": [2069, 2101], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "f4b099a29d739f4c0ac66c7a53fe2248c99d4e82", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc#L2069-L2101"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_executor_processed_tokens.cc", "lines": [92, 132], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "6d5ea9038d0e2e34da8be49a927c1f2284a600cc", "url