te": "Second read, 2026-11-17 (agent a): RollBackProcessedTokens (executor.cc:565-595) still re-pends the token at current_step - 1 as an id-only TokenData; the next prefill then looks up its embeddings (a82611eb, our build only). Agrees with z-repin-c."}
{"id": "X-GAP-010", "verdict": "corrected", "corrected_text": "In our build and the release Agello ships (ours: 3fa97211, 2026-10-24), Decode runs an MTP round only when MtpRoundFitsCache holds: its verify positions p..p+3, with p = current_step - 1 when the drafter is primed (or a round was deferred) and p = current_step after a priming step, must end below the state's entries N; otherwise it decodes a plain step and counts mtp_skipped_cache_end. So no round verifies past position N - 1. Before that commit nothing on the MTP path compared them: a primed round could reach position N + 1 and a priming round right after a prefill that filled the cache N + 3.", "corrected_sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc", "lines": [1355, 1380], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "5a0573835a281b61800362cf9412cb3a6e24e633", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc#L1355-L1380"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc", "lines": [1417, 1432], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "b73c77d8372a713e3a0e5e271e305a489295c68a", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/executor/llm_litert_compiled_model_executor.cc#L1417-L1432"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc", "lines": [1303, 1340], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "527c0489922dd8f135918cc15a09a613b9f6aaac", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e230