, "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.h", "lines": [64, 75], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "24a925268e3d11986f89ab9da58ed3e3490c12e9", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb/runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.h#L64-L75"}], "note": "Second read, 2026-11-17 (agent a): MtpRoundFitsCache (llm_litert_mtp_drafter.h:66-77 at b7b856a0: first = primed ? current_step - 1 : current_step; first + num_draft_steps < num_entries) is called in Decode (executor.cc:1417-1432) with primed || deferred, falling back to a plain step (kMtpSkippedAtCacheEnd); 3fa97211 (2026-10-24) is an ancestor of the release. Agrees with z-repin-e."}
{"id": "X-GAP-019", "verdict": "corrected", "corrected_text": "In the release Agello ships (agello-one-20261115, whose llg_constraint.cc is Google's), LlgConstraint::ComputeNext commits the token into the llguidance constraint object of the state it is given (llg_commit_token on that state's pointer) and returns a copy of that state, which shares the same object through a shared_ptr; only Start() clones a fresh object, so every state derived from one Start() is the same mutable llguidance matcher. In our build (ours: 1382157b, 2026-11-17), ComputeNext clones the given state's matcher and commits into the clone, leaving the given state as it was, and each state's owner keeps the mask llguidance computed for it.", "corrected_sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.cc", "lines": [80, 128], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "73113b0b415c7b75e1314d1a73db59c917833780", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.cc#L80-L128"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.h", "lines": [41, 85], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "d2bac2aa232a8718ae4474ceffe590a0adcae1c7", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.h#L41-L85"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "path": "runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.cc", "lines": [66, 91], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "5ff03053740aea098a4d979feb5e8425b97a6f8d", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.cc#L66-L91"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "path": "runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.h", "lines": [41, 72], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "ab292b5c8bd543c7108d61afeb6110a0e39fe376", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.h#L41-L72"}], "note": "Second read, 2026-11-17 (agent a): llg_constraint.cc:80-102 at b7b856a0 clones the given state's matcher (llg_clone_constraint) and commits into the clone (ours 1382157b, 2026-11-17, not in the release); the release's llg_constraint.cc is byte-identical to Google's base (git diff df6df5b8 6da75396 empty), which commits into the shared matcher. Agrees with z-repin-e."}
{"id": "X-GAP-020", "verdict": "corrected", "corrected_text": "In an MTP round with an llguidance constraint, RunDraftingLoop computes each draft's mask from the current state and then commits the draft with ComputeNext, and RunVerification computes the four row masks from the verified state and the three draft states. In the release Agello ships, those states are one matcher, so by verification all point to the matcher after drafts d1, d2 and d3: verifier rows 0 to 2 get the mask for the position after d3 instead of their own position, and only row 3 is right. In our build each state has a matcher of its own (ours: 1382157b), so each row gets its own position's mask.", "corrected_sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc", "lines": [922, 1005], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "0cf5071e1a6f96d61af35ca3e5f71a2601f2f44e", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc#L922-L1005"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc", "lines": [1254, 1300], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "13870a7198f8805e0146c2f3f9b0fdc5dd52f3c5", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc#L1254-L1300"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "pin": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc", "lines": [540, 610], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "8d4582609fc93fbc09c51ac7c472cea26bea406d", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb/runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc#L540-L610"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "pin": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc", "lines": [703, 750], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "2eb19733869fc586577fefd4ba04126a01bb8828", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb/runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc#L703-L750"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.cc", "lines": [80, 102], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "0e18eab5d7c1f7989d1343105ad0a9e880c2f00a", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.cc#L80-L102"}], "note": "Second read, 2026-11-17 (agent a): the drafter's mask-then-commit order (RunDraftingLoop, b7b856a0 :922-1005) and RunVerification's masks from the verified and draft states (:1254-1300) are unchanged; only ComputeNext differs by build (X-GAP-019). Agrees with z-repin-e."}
{"id": "X-GAP-021", "verdict": "corrected", "corrected_text": "After verification, LlmLiteRtMtpDrafter::Draft sets the verified state to draft state n and commits the bonus token. In the release Agello ships, draft state n is the shared matcher already holding d1 to d3, so the matcher ends at verified tokens + d1 d2 d3 + bonus whatever n is; that matches the emitted tokens only when all 3 drafts are accepted; after a rejection the matcher holds rejected drafts, later masks are computed from that state, and the bonus commit can fail, making Draft return InternalError ('Failed to commit token'). In our build draft state n holds only the verified tokens and d1 to dn, and the bonus is committed into a clone (ours: 1382157b), so the state matches the emitted tokens.", "corrected_sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc", "lines": [1480, 1500], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "f42c249f659c96371b1b37c3d133c8cacf5c8fef", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc#L1480-L1500"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "path": "runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.cc", "lines": [66, 91], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "5ff03053740aea098a4d979feb5e8425b97a6f8d", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.cc#L66-L91"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "pin": "6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc", "lines": [808, 826], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "551e8c95983533433e90250a7519cf4fb2b6240e", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/6da75396ece779d3c7b6b605ec8c2c06861ce1eb/runtime/executor/llm_litert_mtp_drafter.cc#L808-L826"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.cc", "lines": [80, 102], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "0e18eab5d7c1f7989d1343105ad0a9e880c2f00a", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/components/constrained_decoding/llg_constraint.cc#L80-L102"}], "note": "Second read, 2026-11-17 (agent a): Draft's post-verification update (b7b856a0 :1480-1500) sets the verified state to draft state n and commits the bonus; with our cloning ComputeNext (1382157b) draft state n holds only d1..dn, with the release's it is the shared matcher. Agrees with z-repin-e."}
